{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01THggiYDU8YPKuWLxpS7AXW","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tsource_url: \"https://kubernetes.io/releases/\"\n3\tfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:40:00-0400\"\n4\tauthority: \"Kubernetes project (kubernetes.io/releases)\"\n5\tobjectives_covered: [\"D1 Administration\", \"D4 Community and Collaboration\"]\n6\tconcepts_covered: [\"release-cadence\", \"minor-releases\", \"three-supported-releases\", \"patch-support\", \"end-of-life\"]\n7\t---\n8\t# Kubernetes Releases (kubernetes.io/releases/)\n9\t\n10\tThe Kubernetes project maintains release branches for the most recent three minor releases. Kubernetes 1.19 and newer receive approximately 1 year of patch support; Kubernetes 1.18 and older received approximately 9 months of patch support. Currently supported (at the time of this snapshot): 1.36 (end of life 2027-06-28), 1.35 (end of life 2027-02-28), 1.34 (end of life 2026-10-27). Since 2021 the project ships three minor releases per year (approximately every 15 weeks), each following a release cycle led by a SIG Release team; patch releases are cut monthly from the supported branches.\n11\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62653833-9f48-4f95-9546-6ca47ad80449","uuid":"477b400d-5a52-47a5-87d0-4ccff3f5d0cc","timestamp":"2026-08-31T13:34:15.765Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\dev\\lodestar\\Book-KCNA\\sources\\k8s-releases-cadence-2026-08-23.md","content":"---\nsource_url: \"https://kubernetes.io/releases/\"\nfetched_at: \"2026-08-23T23:40:00-0400\"\nauthority: \"Kubernetes project (kubernetes.io/releases)\"\nobjectives_covered: [\"D1 Administration\", \"D4 Community and Collaboration\"]\nconcepts_covered: [\"release-cadence\", \"minor-releases\", \"three-supported-releases\", \"patch-support\", \"end-of-life\"]\n---\n# Kubernetes Releases (kubernetes.io/releases/)\n\nThe Kubernetes project maintains release branches for the most recent three minor releases. Kubernetes 1.19 and newer receive approximately 1 year of patch support; Kubernetes 1.18 and older received approximately 9 months of patch support. Currently supported (at the time of this snapshot): 1.36 (end of life 2027-06-28), 1.35 (end of life 2027-02-28), 1.34 (end of life 2026-10-27). Since 2021 the project ships three minor releases per year (approximately every 15 weeks), each following a release cycle led by a SIG Release team; patch releases are cut monthly from the supported branches.\n","numLines":11,"startLine":1,"totalLines":11}}}
