{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016nk2aq3y9yewPjfKMehwPg","type":"tool_result","content":"# CNCF Technical Advisory Groups Definition and Structure\n\n**Definition and TOC Relationship:**\n\"Technical Advisory Groups (TAGs) are the primary organizational units within the CNCF that oversee and coordinate interests across projects, working groups, and the broader cloud native community.\" They \"serve as bridges between CNCF projects, end users, and the Technical Oversight Committee (TOC).\"\n\n**Currently Active TAGs with Scope:**\n\n1. \"TAG Developer Experience\" - \"Databases, Microservices, Streaming, Messaging, API Management, Developer Frameworks\"\n\n2. \"TAG Infrastructure\" - \"Data, Storage, Network, DNS, Compute, Service Mesh, Infrastructure-as-Code, Edge, Sovereignty, Load Balancing\"\n\n3. \"TAG Operational Resilience\" - \"Observability, Management, Business Continuity, Resource Optimization, Cost Efficiency, Energy, Performance, Troubleshooting, Reliability, Day 2 Operations\"\n\n4. \"TAG Security and Compliance\" - \"Security Hygiene, Policy-as-Code, Compliance, Auditing, Threat Modeling, Secure Software Supply Chain\"\n\n5. \"TAG Workloads Foundation\" - \"Fundamental cloud native workload execution environments and lifecycle management\"\n\n**Restructuring Timeline:**\n\"The current TAG structure was established in 2025 to better align with cloud native ecosystem needs.\""}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62653833-9f48-4f95-9546-6ca47ad80449","uuid":"9b9e0146-2492-41d6-be33-97ea957d5909","timestamp":"2026-08-31T13:37:44.823Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":45965,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CNCF Technical Advisory Groups Definition and Structure\n\n**Definition and TOC Relationship:**\n\"Technical Advisory Groups (TAGs) are the primary organizational units within the CNCF that oversee and coordinate interests across projects, working groups, and the broader cloud native community.\" They \"serve as bridges between CNCF projects, end users, and the Technical Oversight Committee (TOC).\"\n\n**Currently Active TAGs with Scope:**\n\n1. \"TAG Developer Experience\" - \"Databases, Microservices, Streaming, Messaging, API Management, Developer Frameworks\"\n\n2. \"TAG Infrastructure\" - \"Data, Storage, Network, DNS, Compute, Service Mesh, Infrastructure-as-Code, Edge, Sovereignty, Load Balancing\"\n\n3. \"TAG Operational Resilience\" - \"Observability, Management, Business Continuity, Resource Optimization, Cost Efficiency, Energy, Performance, Troubleshooting, Reliability, Day 2 Operations\"\n\n4. \"TAG Security and Compliance\" - \"Security Hygiene, Policy-as-Code, Compliance, Auditing, Threat Modeling, Secure Software Supply Chain\"\n\n5. \"TAG Workloads Foundation\" - \"Fundamental cloud native workload execution environments and lifecycle management\"\n\n**Restructuring Timeline:**\n\"The current TAG structure was established in 2025 to better align with cloud native ecosystem needs.\"","durationMs":4827,"url":"https://contribute.cncf.io/community/tags/"}}
