{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014HGsvpkgLhmLuQyECfaEkB","type":"tool_result","content":"# CNCF TOC Restructuring Summary\n\n**Announcement of TAG Restructuring:**\n\"In order to grow with the ecosystem, the TOC has approved a restructuring of the Technical Advisory Groups\"\n\n**Names of New TAGs:**\n1. Developer Experience\n2. Infrastructure\n3. Operational Resilience\n4. Security and Compliance\n5. Workloads Foundation\n\n**Previous Structure:**\n\"By June 2019, this number had grown to 37 projects and the TOC approved the creation of SIGs, later to be renamed Technical Advisory Groups.\"\n\n**Stated Reason for Change:**\n\"The TOC has been working with the existing TAGs for two years to identify these opportunities for improvement in the TAG structure\" to better \"grow with the ecosystem\" as CNCF expanded from 4 projects in 2015-2016 to 223 contributed projects by 2025."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"62653833-9f48-4f95-9546-6ca47ad80449","uuid":"1e933685-81cf-438a-88fd-2868610bdbb6","timestamp":"2026-08-31T13:37:45.565Z","tool_use_result":{"bytes":176393,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"# CNCF TOC Restructuring Summary\n\n**Announcement of TAG Restructuring:**\n\"In order to grow with the ecosystem, the TOC has approved a restructuring of the Technical Advisory Groups\"\n\n**Names of New TAGs:**\n1. Developer Experience\n2. Infrastructure\n3. Operational Resilience\n4. Security and Compliance\n5. Workloads Foundation\n\n**Previous Structure:**\n\"By June 2019, this number had grown to 37 projects and the TOC approved the creation of SIGs, later to be renamed Technical Advisory Groups.\"\n\n**Stated Reason for Change:**\n\"The TOC has been working with the existing TAGs for two years to identify these opportunities for improvement in the TAG structure\" to better \"grow with the ecosystem\" as CNCF expanded from 4 projects in 2015-2016 to 223 contributed projects by 2025.","durationMs":4153,"url":"https://www.cncf.io/blog/2025/05/07/10-years-in-cloud-native-toc-restructures-technical-groups/"}}
